uve33K2LGtE5Cw1_LAQL_A&oe=6B04C27C", "width": 720, "height": 720, "id": "10", "resolution": "720x720"}, {"url": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/917309486_18099369986662219_1957962619689945040_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=1&ig_cache_key=NDAzMzMxNzA4NDY0MjQ3NTc4MDE4MDk5MzY5OTgzNjYyMjE5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=72FzytAnhKkQ7kNvwGJ214_&_nc_oc=Adr3eq-5s49LJDZDSok8x5nx10DgFdvkfReNL7Hpo1I0AOsiAbhsc7wVpAHTb4j8k7I&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_gid=3-8i-_mVWKK_YdAHqJCnxQ&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_ct=RQosPBUIFQ4lBAAAAA&oh=00_AQSo0l9lXyhlivcTDo4dPLmwqpYle5OrvWaXCOB8IQBlNA&oe=6B04C27C", "width": 720, "height": 1280, "id": "11", "resolution": "720x1280"}], "comments": [{"author": "danielcarbone610", "author_id": "53607167595", "id": "18119294947812764", "text": "It is the end my only friend the end", "timestamp": 1795097889, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "evil_memnoch", "author_id": "69463327273", "id": "18122994670954816", "text": "Better than what the European Union is bringing in.", "timestamp": 1795097767, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "adriangarcianl", "author_id": "1958699332", "id": "18096630905184926", "text": "𝐄𝐥 𝐭𝐢𝐞𝐦𝐩𝐨 𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐟𝐚𝐯𝐨𝐫 𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐚́ 𝐩𝐨𝐫 𝐭𝐞𝐫𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐚𝐫, 📞 al arrepentimiento y reconciliación, el fuego consumidor está por llegar🔥\n\n𝐋𝐚 𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐫𝐚 𝐉 𝐞𝐱𝐢𝐬𝐭𝐞 𝐚𝐩𝐞𝐧𝐚𝐬 𝐞𝐧 𝐞𝐥 𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐥𝐨 𝐗𝐕𝐈, 𝟏,𝟔𝟎𝟎 𝐚𝐧̃𝐨𝐬 𝐝𝐞𝐬𝐩𝐮𝐞́𝐬 𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐧𝐚𝐜𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐨 𝐝𝐞𝐥 𝐌𝐞𝐬𝐢́𝐚𝐬.\n\nEntonces el cordero🐑 que vino a pagar nuestros pecados con su sangre🩸inmolado en un madero, por su amor y misericordia, 𝐍𝐎 𝐬𝐞 𝐥𝐥𝐚𝐦𝐚 𝐉𝐞𝐬𝐮𝐬.\n\nLos del Tefilín que adoran la estrella de Renfán-enemigo siguen el Talmud, vendido por ellos en 30 monedas, hicieron la maldición + fuerte 📛 al llamarlo 𝐘𝐞𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚, viene de 𝐘𝐞𝐬𝐡𝐮, acrónimo de “Yemakj Shemo UeZikhro”sig: “𝐐𝐮𝐞 𝐬𝐮 𝐍𝐨𝐦𝐛𝐫𝐞 𝐲 𝐞𝐥 𝐑𝐞𝐜𝐮𝐞𝐫𝐝𝐨 𝐝𝐞 𝐞́𝐥 𝐬𝐞𝐚𝐧 𝐁𝐨𝐫𝐫𝐚𝐝𝐨𝐬”\n\nDespués persiguen a discípulos para que no predicaran el nombre verdadero 𝐇𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐬 𝟒:𝟏𝟖 𝐲 𝐇𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐬 𝟓:𝟒𝟎\n\nEl Mesías no era ojo verde, tez blanca, cabello largo, será el último engaño de Satán, así vendrá diciendo que es el Cristo para marcar.\n\n𝐉𝐮𝐚𝐧 𝟓:𝟒𝟑 \n𝐘𝐨 𝐡𝐞 𝐯𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐝𝐨 𝐞𝐧 𝐧𝐨𝐦𝐛𝐫𝐞 𝐝𝐞 𝐦𝐢 𝐏𝐚𝐝𝐫𝐞, 𝐲 𝐧𝐨 𝐦𝐞 𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐛𝐢́𝐬; 𝐬𝐢 𝐨𝐭𝐫𝐨 𝐯𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐞𝐫𝐞 𝐞𝐧 𝐬𝐮 𝐩𝐫𝐨𝐩𝐢𝐨 𝐧𝐨𝐦𝐛𝐫𝐞, 𝐚 𝐞𝐬𝐞 𝐫𝐞𝐜𝐢𝐛𝐢𝐫𝐞́𝐢𝐬. \n\n𝐘𝐚𝐡𝐮𝐞́𝐡 (El que causa la existencia)\n𝐘𝐚𝐡𝐮𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚 𝐇𝐚𝐌𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐢́𝐚𝐣 (Yahuéh salva) \n\n𝐸𝑛 𝑒𝑙 𝑛𝑜𝑚𝑏𝑟𝑒 𝑑𝑒𝑙 𝑃𝑎𝑑𝑟𝑒 𝑒𝑠𝑡á 𝑒𝑙 𝑁𝑜𝑚𝑏𝑟𝑒 𝑑𝑒𝑙 𝐻𝑖𝑗𝑜\n\n𝐄𝐳𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐢𝐞𝐥 𝟑𝟗:𝟕 Importancia de su Kadosh Nombre\n\n𝐋𝐨𝐬 𝐣𝐮𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐨𝐬🔥𝐬𝐨𝐧 𝐩𝐨𝐫 𝐑𝐄𝐂𝐇𝐀𝐙𝐀𝐑 𝐒𝐔 𝐍𝐎𝐌𝐁𝐑𝐄 Sofonías 3:8-9\n\n𝐀𝐩𝐨𝐜𝐚𝐥𝐢𝐩𝐬𝐢𝐬 𝟐:𝟏𝟖-𝟐𝟗 Tiatira-Católica el espíritu que adoran NO es la madre de Mashíaj (Miriam),es Jezabel. 𝐄́𝐱𝐨𝐝𝐨 𝟐𝟎:𝟒-𝟓, 𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐨𝐬 𝟏𝟏𝟓:𝟒-𝟖 \n\nApocalipsis 9:20 Aún con plagas 𝐍𝐨 𝐬𝐞 𝐚𝐫𝐫𝐞𝐩𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐞𝐧 𝐝𝐞 𝐇𝐀𝐂𝐄𝐑 𝐈𝐌𝐀́𝐆𝐄𝐍𝐄𝐒.\n\nApocalipsis 2:3 𝐄𝐥 𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐬𝐚𝐣𝐞 𝐚 𝐏𝐞́𝐫𝐠𝐚𝐦𝐨 dice que ahí tenía el trono Satán y en este lugar estaba el altar Zeus, 𝐠𝐞𝐧𝐢𝐭𝐢𝐯𝐨 𝐝𝐞 𝐙𝐞𝐮𝐬= 𝐃𝐢𝐨𝐬. Señor=Baal, Jehova=He aquí la ruina\n\n𝐇𝐞𝐜𝐡𝐨𝐬 𝟒:𝟏𝟐\nY en ningún otro hay salvación; porque 𝐧𝐨 𝐡𝐚𝐲 𝐨𝐭𝐫𝐨 𝐧𝐨𝐦𝐛𝐫𝐞 𝐛𝐚𝐣𝐨 𝐞𝐥 𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐥𝐨, dado a los hombres, en que podamos ser salvos.\n\n𝐍𝐨 ❌𝐘𝐞𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚, 𝐘𝐞𝐡𝐨𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚, 𝐘𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐮𝐚, 𝐉𝐞𝐬𝐮𝐬\n\n𝟏 𝐉𝐮𝐚𝐧 𝟑:𝟐𝟑\nY este es su mandamiento: que creamos en el nombre de su Hijo 𝐘𝐚𝐡𝐮𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚 𝐇𝐚𝐌𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐢́𝐚𝐣 y que nos amemos unos a otros, como él nos ha mandado. \n\nEste 🌎 acaba, sigue 𝐥𝐚 𝐍𝐮𝐞𝐯𝐚 𝐘𝐞𝐫𝐮𝐬𝐡𝐚𝐥𝐚𝐢𝐦,de paz y amor.\n\n𝐡𝐭𝐭𝐩𝐬://𝐥𝐨𝐬𝐝𝐞𝐥𝐜𝐚𝐦𝐢𝐧𝐨.𝐧𝐞𝐭/\n\nO están con su señor y dios (Satán), o con 𝐘𝐚𝐡𝐮𝐞́𝐡, 𝐞𝐥 𝐓𝐨𝐝𝐨𝐩𝐨𝐝𝐞𝐫𝐨𝐬𝐨, y con 𝐘𝐚𝐡𝐮𝐬𝐡𝐮́𝐚 𝐇𝐚𝐌𝐚𝐬𝐡𝐢́𝐚𝐣 𝐧𝐮𝐞𝐬𝐭𝐫𝐨 𝐒𝐚𝐥𝐯𝐚𝐝𝐨𝐫, si están con Él, seguirle, creer y confesar su Kadosh Nombre. 𝐑𝐨𝐦𝐚𝐧𝐨𝐬 𝟏𝟎:𝟏𝟎", "timestamp": 1795097554, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "cinchcook3", "author_id": "47001597091", "id": "18091020554287762", "text": "lol the Zionist call it a NWO so nobody suspects that’s exactly what they’re doing 🤣", "timestamp": 1795097525, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "franciscomcortes", "author_id": "1286766125", "id": "18120292487278699", "text": "The Hopy prophecy as it was tell when the guy with the red hat flew overseas to a meeting with global leaders, after everyone goes back to theirs country's  thats when the skies are going to turn dark and buildings are going to be turned into ashes and there is not going to be sunlight for a long period of time that's when the planet Earth will be cleaned up with the few survivors .", "timestamp": 1795097381, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kevin23.p", "author_id": "3618069713", "id": "18121821026094430", "text": "Mientras muera el socialismo, genial", "timestamp": 1795097309, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ejayufaka", "author_id": "181313488", "id": "18039433256893253", "text": "This meeting is for trump to handout Taiwan and Ukraine. And seeing what he could get in exchange 🤔", "timestamp": 1795097152, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "stotans13", "author_id": "57510784323", "id": "18121713110051303", "text": "Finally. Competent allies.", "timestamp": 1795097114, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "procoachhenry", "author_id": "14964699300", "id": "18079304504768866", "text": "This is powerful 👏👏👏", "timestamp": 1795097114, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "martin_cfm_", "author_id": "5520262417", "id": "18139894693637639", "text": "And my beautiful South America minding their own business 🤣🤣", "timestamp": 1795097063, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tjtjwoah", "author_id": "74885562855", "id": "18173238316463784", "text": "Just like the bible says", "timestamp": 1795097023, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/reels/Df5OITgoP8E/", "webpage_url_basename": "Df5OITgoP8E", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://scontent-ord5-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/917309486_18099369986662219_1957962619689945040_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=1&ig_cache_key=NDAzMzMxNzA4NDY0MjQ3NTc4MDE4MDk5MzY5OTgzNjYyMjE5.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjcyMC5zZHIudmlkZW9fdXNlcl9zZWxlY3RlZF90aHVtYm5haWwuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=72FzytAnhKkQ7kNvwGJ214_&_nc_oc=Adr3eq-5s49LJDZDSok8x5nx10DgFdvkfReNL7